u very much for helping us to improve!\",\n  \"withError\": \"With error\",\n  \"withObservations\": \"With observations\",\n  \"withoutError\": \"No error\",\n  \"documentHasObservation\": \"This document has an observation\",\n  \"suggestedSupplier_alertTitle\": \"We have suggested a supplier based on the document data\",\n  \"suggestedSupplier_alertDescription\": \"Review the information before continuing.\",\n  \"suggestedSupplier_editButton\": \"Edit supplier\",\n  \"suggestedSupplier_acceptButton\": \"Accept suggestion\",\n  \"suggestedSupplier_sectionTitle\": \"Supplier\",\n  \"suggestedSupplier_comercialName\": \"Commercial name\",\n  \"suggestedSupplier_fiscalName\": \"Legal name\",\n  \"suggestedSupplier_cif\": \"Tax ID\",\n  \"suggestedSupplier_address\": \"Address\",\n  \"suggestedSupplier_contact\": \"Contact\",\n  \"suggestedSupplier_phone\": \"Phone\",\n  \"suggestedSupplier_email\": \"Email\",\n  \"editSupplier_title\": \"Edit supplier\",\n  \"editSupplier_supplier\": \"Supplier\",\n  \"editSupplier_suggested\": \"Suggested\",\n  \"editSupplier_infoTab\": \"Information\",\n  \"editSupplier_contactsTab\": \"Contacts\",\n  \"editSupplier_cancel\": \"Cancel\",\n  \"editSupplier_save\": \"Save\",\n  \"editSupplier_saveAndAccept\": \"Save and accept suggestion\"\n}\n"
