t\",\n      \"previewReady\": \"Ready to confirm\",\n      \"executing\": \"Confirming changes...\",\n      \"copy\": \"Nothing is saved until you confirm.\"\n    },\n    \"previous\": \"Previous\"\n  },\n  \"quantityUsed\": \"Quantity used\",\n  \"percentageOfBom\": \"% of recipe\",\n  \"editProductDialogImageAriaLabel\": \"Upload product image\",\n  \"editProductDialogImageAlt\": \"Product image\",\n  \"purchasesTableDocumentPreviewAlt\": \"Document preview\",\n  \"purchasesTablePricePerBaseUnit\": \"Price per base unit\",\n  \"purchasesTablePricePerBaseUnitHelp\": \"We show this price in the product's base unit.\",\n  \"purchasesTablePricePerBaseUnitHelpAriaLabel\": \"More information about price per base unit\",\n  \"formatsRollout\": {\n    \"eligible\": {\n      \"title\": \"Clean up your account\",\n      \"description\": \"Optimize your account and gain efficiency\",\n      \"cta\": \"Clean up my account\"\n    },\n    \"scheduleModal\": {\n      \"title\": \"Schedule account cleanup\",\n      \"description\": \"We will run an overnight analysis process that cleans up your account and enables the new formats structure. You can keep working after it finishes.\",\n      \"confirm\": \"Schedule cleanup\",\n      \"benefits\": {\n        \"execution\": {\n          \"title\": \"Runs overnight\",\n          \"description\": \"Starting at 2:00 AM\"\n        },\n        \"history\": {\n          \"title\": \"Historical data stays safe\",\n          \"description\": \"Your purchase and sales history remains intact\"\n        },\n        \"automation\": {\n          \"title\": \"We handle everything\",\n          \"description\": \"We will review OCR, unify products and suppliers, etc.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"warning\": {\n        \"description\": \"During the overnight process, your account will not be available. We will email you when it finishes.\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"scheduled\": {\n      \"title\": \"Clean up your account\",\n      \"description\": \"Optimize your account and gain efficiency\"\n    },\n    \"scheduledGeneric\": \"Scheduled for an upcoming overnight window\",\n    \"scheduledWithDate\": \"Scheduled for {{date}}\",\n    \"cancelCta\": \"Cancel scheduled cleanup\",\n    \"cancelModal\": {\n      \"title\": \"Cancel the scheduled cleanup?\",\n      \"description\": \"You can schedule it again later if your account is still eligible.\",\n      \"confirm\": \"Cancel cleanup\"\n    },\n    \"running\": {\n      \"title\": \"We are cleaning up your products\",\n      \"description\": \"For a few minutes, some product actions may be unavailable. Avoid making changes until it finishes.\",\n      \"progress\": \"Cleanup progress\",\n      \"status\": \"Cleanup in progress\"\n    },\n    \"completed\": {\n      \"title\": \"Your products are ready\",\n      \"description\": \"The cleanup finished successfully and the account is ready to use formats.\",\n      \"cta\": \"View summary\"\n    },\n    \"successModal\": {\n      \"title\": \"Your account is cleaner\",\n      \"description\": \"The automatic cleanup finished successfully\",\n      \"scoreLabel\": \"Clean account score\",\n      \"cleanAccount\": \"Clean account\",\n      \"improvingAccount\": \"Improving account\",\n      \"qualitativeTitle\": \"Your account is cleaner\",\n      \"qualitativeDescription\": \"The automatic cleanup finished successfully, but we did not receive enough numeric data to calculate a reliable percentage.\",\n      \"secondaryCta\": \"Cancel\",\n      \"primaryCta\": \"View suggestions\",\n      \"progressDescriptor\": \"cleaner\",\n      \"normalizedCopy\": \"We normalized products, suppliers, and formats.\",\n      \"finalCopyPrefix\": \"Review pending suggestions to\",\n      \"finalCopyStrong\": \"get your account to 100%\",\n      \"finalCopySuffix\": \"and keep reliable data across your account.\"\n    },\n    \"failed\": {\n      \"title\": \"We could not complete the cleanup\",\n      \"description\": \"Our team needs to review this account before trying again. Contact support to continue.\",\n      \"reason\": \"Technical detail: {{reason}}\"\n    },\n    \"errors\": {\n      \"unauthorized\": \"You do not have permission to schedule or cancel this cleanup.\",\n      \"generic\": \"We could not complete the action. Try again later or contact support.\",\n      \"loadTitle\": \"We could not load the cleanup status\",\n      \"loadDescription\": \"Try again or contact support if it keeps failing.\",\n      \"retry\": \"Try again\"\n    },\n    \"toasts\": {\n      \"scheduled\": \"Cleanup scheduled successfully.\",\n      \"cancelled\": \"Cleanup cancelled successfully.\"\n    },\n    \"metrics\": {\n      \"productsUnified\": \"Products unified\",\n      \"suppliersUnified\": \"Suppliers unified\",\n      \"orphanProductsDeleted\": \"Empty products deleted\",\n      \"uomsNormalized\": \"UOMs normalized\"\n    },\n    \"lock\": {\n      \"title\": \"Cleaning your account\",\n      \"description\": \"Running analysis process\",\n      \"processLabel\": \"See you in a few hours\",\n      \"progressLabel\": \"Cleanup progress\",\n      \"stageLabel\": \"Current cleanup steps\",\n      \"stepsLabel\": \"Cleanup step indicator\",\n      \"imagePlaceholder\": \"Image UI\",\n      \"imagePlaceholderLabel\": \"Cleanup step visual\"\n    },\n    \"executionSlides\": {\n      \"ocrReliability\": {\n        \"title\": \"OCR at 99% reliability\",\n        \"description\": \"We simplified how your OCR reads. With 99% reliability, our OCR will now only read these units: unit, kg, l and box to avoid duplicates and unify products.\",\n        \"stage\": \"Normalizing products\"\n      },\n      \"cleanProducts\": {\n        \"title\": \"Clean products without noise\",\n        \"description\": \"Your products can be cleaner thanks to the normalization modal. Click an existing product and clean its name and formats with AI analysis and suggestions.\",\n        \"stage\": \"Unifying products\"\n      },\n      \"unifyFormats\": {\n        \"title\": \"Unify formats\",\n        \"description\": \"If you have a product with more than one identical format, you can unify them under the same one using the button inside the Formats tab on the product page.\",\n        \"stage\": \"Joining orphan data\"\n      },\n      \"movePurchaseLines\": {\n        \"title\": \"Move purchase lines\",\n        \"description\": \"When a purchase line does not fit the product it is assigned to, you can reassign it to the right one in a couple of clicks.\",\n        \"stage\": \"Cleaning the OCR\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"blockedActions\": {\n      \"reason\": \"Product and format actions are paused in the app while cleanup finishes.\"\n    },\n    \"bannersCarousel\": {\n      \"label\": \"Product alerts\",\n      \"previous\": \"Previous product alert\",\n      \"next\": \"Next product alert\",\n      \"navigation\": \"Product alert navigation\",\n      \"goToAlert\": \"Go to product alert {{index}}\"\n    },\n    \"scheduledEstimate\": \"Estimated for {{date}} at {{time}}\"\n  }\n}\n"
